{'symbol': 'KDP', 'date': '2022-03-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'KEURIG DR PEPPER ANNOUNCES NEW ASPIRATION FOR NET POSITIVE WATER IMPACT BY 2050', 'text': "IN SUPPORT OF ITS NEW AMBITION, KDP JOINS THE WATER RESILIENCE COALITION, BOLSTERING THE COMPANY'S EXISTING WATER STEWARDSHIP COMMITMENTS AND RESILIENCY ACROSS ITS VALUE CHAIN BURLINGTON, MASS. AND FRISCO, TEXAS , MARCH 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN CELEBRATION OF WORLD WATER DAY, KEURIG DR PEPPER (NASDAQ: KDP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY'S ASPIRATION TO ACHIEVE NET POSITIVE WATER IMPACT BY 2050 AND HAS JOINED THE WATER RESILIENCE COALITION (WRC)."}